575
00:54:06,125 --> 00:54:08,925
無限の彼方へ
To the far side of infinity!

576
00:54:08,925 --> 00:54:10,525
ご一緒に！ はいっ！
All together! Here we go!

577
00:54:10,525 --> 00:54:13,425
隠しきれない熱い想いと
With this passionate feeling I cannot conceal,

578
00:54:13,425 --> 00:54:16,025
今を走れ走れ
Run, run through the present!

579
