負けない誓い 一緒に掲げて
Raising our unyielding vow together,

580
00:54:19,325 --> 00:54:21,425
行こう
Let's go!

581
00:54:21,425 --> 00:54:24,225
あれやこれやと艶やかに舞う
Dancing vividly through this and that,

582
00:54:24,225 --> 00:54:26,925
予感に誘われ
Drawn in by anticipation,

583
00:54:26,925 --> 00:54:31,825
情熱は燃えて羽ばたくの
Passion ignites and takes flight!

584
